  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "AI can help teenagers and students learn in several ways.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Personalised learning: AI can know better about students, including their advantages, weaknesses, skills, learning favourites, and learning needs, and so on.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Then it can create a proper learning plan for each student.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "This can help students concentrate on areas that they need to improve at their own speed.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Interactive learning: Forget about the learning method of yesterday!",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "AI has the ability to make learning more interactive and interesting.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Interactive learning apps and educational games can make students learn more carefully.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "The new method is sure to be more helpful than studying alone.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Automated advice and help: AI can examine students' work and provide personalised help.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "For example, ChatGPT can answer students' questions quickly in a private, low-pressure way.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "This kind of advice and answers can help students better understand knowledge and use their knowledge.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Greater resources: AI can make learning resources richer and wider, like electronic textbooks, online courses, and study apps.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "For example, a biology textbook with AI technology may provide interactive 3D models of a human body.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "Students may also be able to talk to a simulated empress in history to know more about her life, for example, whom she chose to marry and why.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "AI can provide interactive examples, introduce important passages, and offer assessments.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "In a word, AI has a great ability to improve studying and learning.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "By using AI, students can study smarter and reach higher levels of learning and success.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "The future of AI in education is hopeful as technologies continue to develop.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
